WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.984
Long ago, sentries on Qin's northern frontier kept watch over the distance, alert day and night.

00:00:07.384 --> 00:00:13.120
One morning, dust rose in the distance as enemy cavalry charged toward the frontier.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:20.696
The alarm sounded, beacon fires were lit, and the news quickly reached the capital, Xianyang.

00:00:21.096 --> 00:00:25.920
Qin Shi Huang decided to do something great: join the old walls into one line.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:30.904
General Meng Tian was ordered to oversee the work, leading craftsmen north.

00:00:31.304 --> 00:00:35.432
The worksite bustled with energy as people sang while carrying bricks and building the wall.

00:00:35.832 --> 00:00:42.768
Brick by brick the wall rose, section by section it joined, growing longer and longer.

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:48.352
Seen from the sky, the Great Wall lay like a giant dragon across the northern mountains.

00:00:48.752 --> 00:00:56.024
When the wall was finished, soldiers patrolled on top of it, banners flying in the wind.

00:00:56.424 --> 00:01:02.050
Today, the magnificent Great Wall stretches across the mountains — the pride of the Chinese people.
